"basicUsage.browse.title" = "Move through photos";
"basicUsage.browse.body" = "Previous / next: %@ / %@. Change the number of images per screen in the viewing controls. ↑/↓ selects a row in All at Once or within the current multiple-item Viewer page, with Tagging ON or OFF. It stops at the first and last rows. With Tagging ON or OFF, ←/→ moves a full page in Viewer or one item in All at Once.";
