"basicUsage.tags.title" = "Tag photos and videos";
"basicUsage.tags.body" = "With Tagging ON (⇧⌘M), use 1–4 · QWER · ASDF to toggle multiple tags on the current item. Each Tags button in Viewer or All at Once affects only its photo or video. OFF restores ordinary shortcuts. Tag names and colors are editable; “Delete” and “Upload” are only marks, not file actions. In Image Comparison, choose A Only, B Only, or Both under Apply Tags.";
"basicUsage.map.title" = "Choose areas on the map";
"basicUsage.map.body" = "Select up to three map areas to browse photos with location data in Viewer or All at Once. The blue banner shows the area and photo counts. Back to map restores the last map position and zoom; Clear Map Area removes only the location filter.";
"basicUsage.edit.title" = "Edit and save a copy";
